{"user": "I wasn't expecting my black disc to flip to white. Where should I go next?", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T13:51:27.121944+00:00", "assistant": "Go **c8**.\n\nAnd yes\u2014your Black discs can flip back to White later if White places a disc that sandwiches them in a straight line. Only **corners** are permanent once taken. Here, **c8** is the best endgame move because it keeps your edge position strong and avoids giving White an easy corner swing.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T13:51:30.170721+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T13:51:31.007470+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"], "gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Positive Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction"]}}
{"user": "I mean b7 flipped to white- why>", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:03.083503+00:00", "assistant": "Because White played **a8** (the corner). Your **b7** disc was on the diagonal between **a8** and White\u2019s **c6** disc:\n\n**a8 (White) \u2013 b7 (your Black) \u2013 c6 (White)**\n\nSo **b7 was sandwiched** and flipped to White. Corners like **a8** are permanent, and squares next to corners/diagonal to corners can be dangerous in the endgame.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:11.305038+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:12.537194+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 2, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 1, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 0.3333333333333333, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
{"user": "So diagonals count? I thought it was just straight lines?", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:48.491457+00:00", "assistant": "Yes\u2014**diagonals count**. In Othello, \u201cstraight lines\u201d means any of the **8 directions**:\n\n- horizontal\n- vertical\n- diagonal\n\nSo a disc can flip along a diagonal like **a8\u2013b7\u2013c6** if it gets sandwiched.\n\nFor this turn, only the pale-dot squares are legal: **g2, b6, a7, c8**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:51.508816+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T13:52:52.400865+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Local Justification": 1, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Local Justification": 0.3333333333333333, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
