{"user": "I thought it would flip the whole diagonal. Why isn't h1 available?", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T13:54:50.405116+00:00", "assistant": "Diagonals count, but only if the line is **continuous**: your new disc \u2192 White discs \u2192 your Black disc, with **no empty square gap**.\n\n**h1 isn\u2019t legal** because:\n- diagonal **h1\u2013g2** hits an **empty square**, so no flip;\n- row **h1\u2013g1\u2013\u2026\u2013a1** has Whites, but ends at **empty a1**, not a Black disc.\n\nFor the move: I\u2019d choose **a3**, not **g2**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T13:54:57.697625+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T13:54:58.900721+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 1, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Negative Feedback": 3}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Negative Feedback": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negati